{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "spec-SPEC-001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## [[_aiHumanInteract/specs/nodes/SPEC-001.md|SPEC-001 · 核心光谱画布零模态阻塞与显式授权铁律]]\n\n**INVARIANT** (`must_not` · `enforced`)\n\n光谱分析主画布严禁弹出阻断式技术确认弹窗，且沉默或超时绝不视同技术授权。"
    },
    {
      "id": "spec-SPEC-002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 450,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## [[_aiHumanInteract/specs/nodes/SPEC-002.md|SPEC-002 · 统一谱峰可寻址标识词典 (PeakHandle)]]\n\n**GLOSSARY** (`canonical_term` · `enforced`)\n\n全栈代码、持久化存储与人机对话统一使用 PeakHandle (PK-###) 指代可寻址谱峰，严禁同义词混用。"
    },
    {
      "id": "spec-SPEC-003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## [[_aiHumanInteract/specs/nodes/SPEC-003.md|SPEC-003 · 建筑极简柔和视觉与模块单向解耦开发标准]]\n\n**STANDARD** (`must` · `enforced`)\n\n界面遵循暖灰纸感低视觉疲劳色板，后端存储模块与分拣模块保持单向零循环依赖。"
    },
    {
      "id": "spec-SPEC-004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## [[_aiHumanInteract/specs/nodes/SPEC-004.md|SPEC-004 · 三态技术分拣闸门与知识债状态机契约]]\n\n**CONTRACT** (`must` · `enforced`)\n\n规定 classify_disclosure 输入输出契约及知识债 open -> affirmed | rejected 状态流转后置条件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "spec-SPEC-005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 450,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## [[_aiHumanInteract/specs/nodes/SPEC-005.md|SPEC-005 · 废止旧规范：按内部风险分静默省略技术披露]]\n\n**STANDARD** (`should` · `superseded`)\n\n早期草拟标准：允许 Agent 自行评估风险低于阈值时跳过全部技术栈说明（因违背知情权废止）。"
    }
  ],
